senses.gloss:
याष्टीक याष्टीक (fr. 2. यष्टि), अस्, ई, अम्,
armed with a stick or club, having a staff of office;
(अस्), m. a warrior armed with a club.

यस्मात् यस्मात्, ind. (abl. of 3. य or यद्;
correlative of तस्मात्, q. v.), from which, from which
cause, since, as, because; that, in order that.
